#: src/pages/Home/components/FeatureGrid/FeatureGrid.tsx
msgid "Every upload is squeezed down and sealed before it is stored. You never configure a cipher or pick an archive format."
msgstr "Every upload is squeezed down and sealed before it is stored. You never configure a cipher or pick an archive format."

#: src/pages/Drive/components/ShareEntryDialog/ShareEntryDialog.tsx
msgid "Everyone you add here sees this entry, and everything under it."
msgstr "Everyone you add here sees this entry, and everything under it."

#: src/pages/Drive/components/EntryActions/EntryActions.tsx
msgid "Everything inside this folder is deleted with it. This cannot be undone."
msgstr "Everything inside this folder is deleted with it. This cannot be undone."

#: src/pages/Legal/Terms/Terms.tsx
msgid "Files are compressed and encrypted automatically, without any action on your part. Sharing is granular: each share names a single file or a single folder and gives the recipient one of three roles — viewer, editor or manager. A share never grants access to anything above the item you picked."
msgstr "Files are compressed and encrypted automatically, without any action on your part. Sharing is granular: each share names a single file or a single folder and gives the recipient one of three roles — viewer, editor or manager. A share never grants access to anything above the item you picked."

#: src/pages/Legal/Mentions/Mentions.tsx
msgid "Files uploaded by users remain the property of their authors. Driftbox claims no right over them beyond what is strictly needed to store, compress, encrypt, preview and deliver them back to the people you shared them with."
msgstr "Files uploaded by users remain the property of their authors. Driftbox claims no right over them beyond what is strictly needed to store, compress, encrypt, preview and deliver them back to the people you shared them with."

#: src/pages/Legal/Terms/Terms.tsx
msgid "Files you delete are removed from the browsable listing straight away and purged from storage within thirty days. Deleting your account removes your profile, your files and every share you granted; shares that other people granted to you simply stop being visible to you."
msgstr "Files you delete are removed from the browsable listing straight away and purged from storage within thirty days. Deleting your account removes your profile, your files and every share you granted; shares that other people granted to you simply stop being visible to you."

